.TH agent-manifest 1  "agent-manifest " 
.SH NAME
agent\-manifest \- Emit nxf\*(Aqs declared contribution to the shared agent file (the AGENTS.md section, the prime command, the SessionStart hook) as data. The `nxs` umbrella assembles the shared files from each active module\*(Aqs manifest; `\-\-json` is the machine contract
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBagent\-manifest\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit nxf\*(Aqs declared contribution to the shared agent file (the AGENTS.md section, the prime command, the SessionStart hook) as data. The `nxs` umbrella assembles the shared files from each active module\*(Aqs manifest; `\-\-json` is the machine contract
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
